1731 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I am an interdisciplinary artist working across movement\054 film\054 and interactive systems\054 using choreography as a way to think\054 test\054 and build ideas\056 My practice explores how bodies communicate\054 adapt\054 and are shaped through systems of intimacy\054 control\054 and perception in digital contexts\056 I work through experimentation\054 collaboration\054 and embodied inquiry to create experiences that merge movement\054 critical research\054 and technology\056\n)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 1732 0 R
     /Pg 1727 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
