1737 0 obj
  << /ActualText (FOUNDER \046 CREATIVE DIRECTOR \174 R\056E\056S\056T\056A\056G\056E Collective\050Copeland Park Gallery\054 London\054 2025 \023 Present\n\nR\056E\056S\056T\056A\056G\056E is a multidisciplinary collective and curatorial platform exploring feminist approaches to movement\054 embodiment\054 and technology\056 The collective brings together choreographers\054 performers\054 designers\054 and creative technologists to develop research\055led performances\054 exhibitions\054 and public programmes\056\nThrough exhibitions\054 live performances\054 workshops\054 and panel discussions\054 R\056E\056S\056T\056A\056G\056E creates news spaces for experimentation\054 dialogue\054 and collective inquiry around bodies\054 systems\054 and contemporary modes of connection\056 The platform supports emerging artists in developing choreographic work that sits between performance\054 research\054 and digital practice\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 1738 0 R
     /Pg 1727 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

