1739 0 obj
  << /ActualText (DIRECTOR \174\240Cycles\240\023 Immersive Dance \046 Technology Project\nRoyal College of Art and Frameless\054 London\054 2024 \023 Present\nAwarded with the LOL SERGENT LENS AWARD\n\050Immersive dance work exploring internalized behaviours\054 repetition\054 and control through movement\054 film\054 sound\054 and spatial composition\056\050Developed through studio research\054 studies of phemenology \050Kozel\056S\051 performance\054 and film making\054 with ongoing expansion into VR and installation formats\056\n\050Presented at\072 Frameless London \0502025\051\054 Copeland Gallery \0502026\051\050Collaborators\072 dancer Emma Poyer\054 sound designer Zlata Mechetina\054 photographer Anushka Tendolkar\n)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 1740 0 R
     /Pg 1727 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

