  << /ActualText (Choreo\055Graphic Systems\072 Bodies\054 Tech and Justice\050Copeland Gallery\054 London \174 February 2026\n\050Group exhibition and live programme featuring performances\054 installations\054 and panels on movement\054 technology\054 and social justice\056 Organised as part of the Emerging Artists Programme hosted by Copeland Park\050)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 1742 0 R
