1753 0 obj
  << /ActualText (MOVEMENT DIRECTOR \174\240Ada \046 Hamlet\050Produced by Fetchish\056net \024 Etcetera Theatre\054 London\054 \n2024 \055 2025\n\nMovement direction for a contemporary theatre production\054 focusing on physical dramaturgy\054 embodiment\054 and the relationship between movement and narrative\056\050Worked closely with the director and actors to develop a movement language and physical dramaturgy\056\n\nMOVEMENT DIRECTOR \046 CO\055CHOREOGRAPHER \174Forbidden Love\054 music video by AYA\054 2024\n\nMovement direction and co\055choreography with Daphne Peters for a music video featuring six contemporary dancers\056\050Developed a movement language translating musical rhythm and emotional narrative into physical expression for camera\056\n\n)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 1754 0 R
     /Pg 1727 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
